       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYMAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY "copybooks/PAY-RECORD.cpy".
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-SECTION.
           INITIALIZE PAYMENT-RECORD
           MOVE "PAY000001" TO PAY-ID
           MOVE "A" TO PAY-STATUS
           ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
           DISPLAY "PAYMENT: " PAY-ID " STATUS: " PAY-STATUS
           DISPLAY "RECORDS PROCESSED: " WS-COUNT
           MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
           GOBACK.
